      "message": "This change might have been a bit excessive from the Ganesh side. At the outset, it wasn\u0027t clear to me if the functions in SkGr.h needed to take the Bitmap+Mipmap version or just the Bitmap one. GrProxyProvider.h definitely needed to use the Bitmap+Mipmap version. Now having updated all the calls to `GrMakeCachedBitmapProxyView` and `GrMakeUncachedBitmapProxyView`, I don\u0027t think that was necessary. However, I do like the `std::optional` make pattern over the existing pattern of making a Bitmap and calling installPixels and only sometimes validating that, so maybe that was worth it?\n\nFeedback welcome (e.g. reduce the scope, break it into two steps, etc)",
